      "statement": "Live sandbox handles are held in a process-local `Map<taskId, Sandbox>` in `lib/sandbox/sandbox-registry.ts`; cross-request reconnection uses `Sandbox.get(sandboxId)` against the persisted `tasks.sandboxId`, not the in-memory map.",
