      "statement": "OAuth tokens, API keys, and MCP connector `env`/`oauthClientSecret` are stored at rest as `aes-256-cbc` ciphertext via `lib/crypto.ts`; they are decrypted only on the server, immediately before being passed to a sandbox or applied to `process.env` for an agent invocation.",
