      "id": "claim_a140d06d1a77409fb447ec5babfd192a",
      "statement": "The agent dispatcher snapshots `OPENAI_API_KEY`, `GEMINI_API_KEY`, `CURSOR_API_KEY`, `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY`, `AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY`, `GH_TOKEN`, and `GITHUB_TOKEN` from `process.env`, overlays per-user keys, and restores the originals in a `finally` block so the worker process cannot leak one user's credentials to the next user.",
