    {
      "id": "claim_29dae31e8db74ecf87adae48a401c12d",
      "statement": "Cancellation is cooperative: `PATCH /api/tasks/[taskId]` with `action: 'stop'` flips `status` to `'stopped'` and calls `killSandbox(taskId)`, and the worker discovers the change at one of five `isTaskStopped` checkpoints in `processTask` (plus four more inside `createSandbox` and one at the entry of `executeAgentInSandbox`).",
