      "id": "claim_607c2333caed45aca0c96e7d57cb43f5",
      "statement": "Authentication supports two OAuth providers, gated by `NEXT_PUBLIC_AUTH_PROVIDERS`: Vercel as a first-class primary sign-in, and GitHub as either a primary sign-in or a linked account recorded in the `accounts` table on top of an existing Vercel user; the session is a JWE-signed cookie with a one-year TTL.",
