      "id": "claim_917c1dee204e49e0bca1b90001373eb2",
      "statement": "Rate limiting (`checkRateLimit`) counts both tasks created today and user-role messages sent today across all of the user's tasks in a UTC day; the cap is `MAX_MESSAGES_PER_DAY` from `lib/constants.ts` (default 5), overridable per user via the `settings` table; the POST handler returns 429 with the remaining count and reset time when exceeded.",
