    {
      "id": "claim_9da269fb25a64b58913874f6e1a65ad3",
      "statement": "Sandbox creation runs in a strict sequence: validate per-agent env requirements and `SANDBOX_VERCEL_*` credentials, build an authenticated repo URL (`createAuthenticatedRepoUrl` embeds the GitHub token as username / `x-oauth-basic` as password for github.com), `Sandbox.create`, immediate `registerSandbox`, shallow `git clone` to `/vercel/sandbox/project`, optional `package.json`/`requirements.txt` dependency install with package-manager detection, optional dev-server auto-start (Next.js 16 gets a `--webpack` flag, Vite gets a host-allow patch), optional `agent-browser` install with an agent-specific skill file, git config, and branch resolution (AI branch → local → remote → new).",
