      "statement": "Execution logs live as a JSONB column on `tasks` (`tasks.logs`), written by `TaskLogger` which reads the row, appends a `LogEntry`, and writes it back; the user/agent conversation is kept in a separate `task_messages` table so streaming agents can update a single message row in place via `agentMessageId` instead of appending one log entry per token.",
