      "statement": "Task deletion is soft-delete via the `deletedAt` column: single-task `DELETE /api/tasks/[taskId]` sets `deletedAt` on that row, and `DELETE /api/tasks?action=completed,failed,stopped` bulk-soft-deletes by terminal status; list/read queries filter on `isNull(tasks.deletedAt)` so deleted rows are hidden from the UI.",
